Third-party components
----------------------
This repository does not vendor third-party source code. Components are fetched at build time from their
registries or pinned releases and keep their own licenses:

- Rust crates of the engine and CLI: see crates/THIRD_PARTY.md. All are permissive. deny.toml denies GPL
  everywhere except the optional development backend crates/euc-unicorn (Unicorn Engine, GPL-2.0), which is used
  only as a test oracle during development and is never part of a release build.
- MuJoCo 3.9.0 (Apache-2.0, Copyright DeepMind Technologies Limited), the physics engine, linked
  dynamically from the official release that tools/fetch-mujoco downloads and checks.
- Firmware: CMSIS 6 Core headers (Apache-2.0) and Unity (MIT), downloaded at configure time with pinned
  versions and sha256 checks; see firmware/README.md.
- EUC Studio app: npm packages and fonts, see app/THIRD_PARTY.md.

One file adapts third-party source: firmware/core/math/libm.c derives its asin, atan and atan2 from fdlibm,
under this notice (kept in the file):

  Copyright (C) 1993 by Sun Microsystems, Inc. All rights reserved.
  Developed at SunPro, a Sun Microsystems, Inc. business.
  Permission to use, copy, modify, and distribute this software is freely granted, provided that this notice
  is preserved.

Binary releases include the full license texts of everything they bundle.

