are used only to say which hardware a profile or firmware targets.

Stock firmware
--------------
EUC Studio does not include or redistribute any manufacturer's firmware. The `euc fetch` command downloads
official images from the manufacturer's public update server to the user's own machine and checks them against
pinned sha256 hashes.
